FHS0HKtVTtZOd2bWZNtwXT9qObuqVjNicibYQiavib3EibFhewUJMYdziapvHQfibXicHcYtMEpx6rDCaicLicMORrFw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tVW4FHS0HKtVTtZOd2bWZNtwXT9qObuqOz0xZS2WGO6glia0TqK1s0Yp58S9jcCQbeYLaFQ7ltzl8dTIC0rwRNw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>🌟 主题背景</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tVW4FHS0HKtVTtZOd2bWZNtwXT9qObuqic88qdHjdib96U5NbiajBNLxJ0rPEiaica5joy4jcQZ6f41ogDPEldicx1RQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/4cpVDn8PTs32Z0vlnFwqm4FakUbH4QadImArE2kPbNhe9icibJ6NoH9LFHe7FMRwZIee3ZdV3HM0eFKbNkH8cH9Q/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>当人工智能与城市规划碰撞，元宇宙与生态景观交融，未来的城市将如何生长？来自不同专业的你，心中30年后的景观与城市是怎样的场景？</span></span></p><p><span><span>人工智能、元宇宙、无人驾驶、低空经济等前沿技术如何重塑城市空间与人居环境，关注技术革新带来的城市功能布局转型、建筑空间形态演化以及生态景观系统的重构。本次活动覆盖建筑学、城乡规划、风景园林与地理信息系统等多个学科方向，聚焦动态响应环境、构建适应性强的可持续建筑、智慧城市空间决策支持、多维生态景观营造等关键议题。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qs6anzTuWbjIo8w6M4SibCUPnvIVfLfPias4eI8jibQc6e2EticFWv1Uc4XiaficUBUibgpdZvjLJyWo6CwO3RKxlJbmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/HsYCXl8ToGufib46gCfueOMDODJWKv3uzZkgeDeJwP7wAb8fmKZ8RgDIaiboSdN6sgFKg4RtsHo0ic5bKBeIga6Dw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>🛠 活动目的</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tVW4FHS0HKtVTtZOd2bWZNtwXT9qObuqic88qdHjdib96U5NbiajBNLxJ0rPEiaica5joy4jcQZ6f41ogDPEldicx1RQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为了促进跨专业学术交流、培养学生多学科交叉能力，增进各高校学生对深圳大学研究生培养的了解，让学生近距离感受学术氛围和教育特色，深圳大学建筑与城市规划学院现面向全国优秀学子举办主题为“30年后的景观与城市”的暑期学校。本次活动主要针对测绘、遥感、地理信息、人工智能、建筑与城市，致力于搭建一个多学科跨界交流的平台，联合校企资源，与各优秀学子齐聚一堂，共同探讨学术的奥秘。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/4cpVDn8PTs32Z0vlnFwqm4FakUbH4Qad06vHIo1ewpB1RRzLKDVENuZqfTMaLWklXa4PAP1Xy1ibAB5U5hkeziaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qs6anzTuWbjIo8w6M4SibCUPnvIVfLfPias4eI8jibQc6e2EticFWv1Uc4XiaficUBUibgpdZvjLJyWo6CwO3RKxlJbmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/HsYCXl8ToGufib46gCfueOMDODJWKv3uzZkgeDeJwP7wAb8fmKZ8RgDIaiboSdN6sgFKg4RtsHo0ic5bKBeIga6Dw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>🎉 申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tVW4FHS0HKtVTtZOd2bWZNtwXT9qObuqic88qdHjdib96U5NbiajBNLxJ0rPEiaica5joy4jcQZ6f41ogDPEldicx1RQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>暑期学校计划招收80-100人。学员可通过网上申请报名，具体申请条件：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>（1）就读于具有硕士推免权的普通高校，建筑学、城市规划、风景园林、测绘、地理信息、遥感、地理与资源环境相关专业的优秀应届生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）四/五年综合绩点排名前20%，或创新能力突出。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）优先录取获得或即将推免资格的申请人。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tVW4FHS0HKtVTtZOd2bWZNtwXT9qObuqtfUuHGZ6CogAEC9V5ZMiciaEHa1PQsDbeNLicseecibuDgwcTnBmiaqic9Fg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>📁 申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/tVW4FHS0HKtVTtZOd2bWZNtwXT9qObuqic88qdHjdib96U5NbiajBNLxJ0rPEiaica5joy4jcQZ6f41ogDPEldicx1RQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）</span><strong><span>个人简历</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>（2）</span><strong><span>作品集</span></strong><span>（建筑 / 规划 / 风景园林专业提供，5个作品左右，50M以内），</span><em><span>请按照“2025 暑期学校 + 姓名” 邮件命名，发送至 saup_fjylx@126.com；</span></em></p><p><span>（3）</span><strong><span>其它能够体现本人学习及科研能力的证明材料</span></strong><span>（各类获奖证书、学术论文首页、四六级成绩证明、本科在校成绩单等）。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"n